

1. Gutangira:

Mbanje kubashimira kubw'uko mwitabiriye iki gikorwa cyo gusezera kuri mwene wacu, witabye Imana. akaba yar'umunyeshuri mugenzi wange nabandi banyeshuri muri rusange biganye .

Buri wese uri hano afite agahinda  ariko mu gihe nk'iki tugomba gufata umwanya wo kwibuka no gusubiza amaso inyuma ku buzima bw'uwo twatakaje."
   
2. Gushimira umunyeshuri witabye Imana:

Uyu munsi turasezera tunazirikana ubuzima bw'umunyeshuri mugenzi wacu, [UHIRIWE Naome], wiganye natwe, akaba yararanzwe n'umuhate, ubunyangamugayo, n'ubwitange muri byose."
Nubwo tutakiri kumwe nawe muburyo bwumubiri, ibikorwa byiza yakoze n'umutima w'urukundo yagaragaje bizahora byibukwa."

3. Gukomeza k'umubabaro:


 Twese turi kumwe mu kababaro, ariko tugomba kwihangana, kuko n'ubwo uyu munsi turi mu mwijima, tuzabona umucyo w'uko ari mu mahoro."
Nta kintu cyoroshye kuri twe twese, ariko tuzajya tumwibuka mu buryo bwiza, duharanira ko ibyo yakoze bitazibagirana."

4. Gusoza:

 Mu gihe dusubira mu buzima busanzwe, twibukiranye ko tuzahora dufite umurage w'umuvandimwe umunyeshuri mugenzi wacu, kandi ibyo yakoze bizahora bidufasha gukura no kugana imbere."
Turasezera, ariko twizera ko ari mu biganza by'Imana kandi ibyo yakoze bizakomeza kudutera imbaraga."

